# RESETIUS | ADH156_6 { ; Anthony Hanmer 2000
# RESETIUS |   Angle 36 ; Cesaro variation alphabet:  6
# RESETIUS |   Axiom \90d\90ddd\90dddddd\90ddd\90ddd\90ddd
